  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partner Identification Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Members of DSU will visit the Labour Party of Kenya Youth Congress (LPKYC) in Kenya. Our two organizations have collaborated before and following recent interactions, we see great potential for new cooperation with mutual benefit through collaboration on strengthening the democratic capabilities and political representation of Kenyan youth. A Partner Identification will help with developing a mutual understanding between our organizations; allow us to see if we can establish a productive relationship; and create a solid foundation for future project collaboration.</narrative>
  </description>
